# knowledge/ = node-local research + gossiped-tier perception (surveys, findings). NOT the genome.
# Operator decision 2026-06-13: research docs carry too much node-specifics (real IPs, server configs)
# to belong in a PUBLIC genome — the prior "durable docs stay tracked" policy is exactly how a phaedra
# WireGuard-server doc leaked (7ba754f). The whole dir is node-local now: it propagates node-to-node
# (gossip/trace/scp), never via git. Genome = generic skeleton (scripts/ + docs/ + CLAUDE.md). To share
# a genuinely-generic lesson, promote it to docs/ DELIBERATELY — never auto-commit from knowledge/.
knowledge/
